.max-w-5xl.mx-auto.px-4.py-16
  %h1.text-4xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Welcome to Car Advertisements Web
  %p.text-lg.text-gray-600.mb-12.max-w-3xl
    Browse, search, and manage car advertisements. This is a simple learning project demonstrating basic CRUD operations and authentication patterns.

  .grid.grid-cols-1.md:grid-cols-2.gap-6
    = link_to cars_path, class: "group p-8 border-2 border-blue-100 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/30 hover:bg-blue-50 transition" do
      %h3.text-xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Browse Cars
      %p.text-gray-600 View all car advertisements with sorting and pagination

    .p-8.border.border-gray-200.rounded-xl.hover:shadow-sm.transition
      %h3.text-xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Search
      %p.text-gray-600 Find specific cars using advanced search filters

    .p-8.border.border-gray-200.rounded-xl.hover:shadow-sm.transition
      %h3.text-xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Create Account
      %p.text-gray-600 Sign up to save searches and manage your preferences

    = link_to help_path, class: "p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl hover:shadow-sm transition block" do
      %h3.text-xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Help
      %p.text-gray-600 Learn how to use the platform and find answers to common questions

  .mt-12.p-8.bg-gray-50.rounded-xl.border.border-gray-100
    %h3.text-lg.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 About This Project
    %p.text-gray-600.text-sm.leading-relaxed
      This is a reference implementation for learning Ruby on Rails with a Tailwind CSS frontend. The UI is intentionally minimal to focus on functionality and best practices.
